        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: காலநிலை",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "காலநிலை — kālanilai — \"climate\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "இந்த ஊரின் காலநிலை எனக்குப் பிடிக்கும். inta ūriṉ kālanilai eṉakkup piṭikkum. I like the climate of this town."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "காலம், a season, + நிலை, a state."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "காலநிலை (kālanilai) is built from காலம், \"time, a season\", borrowed from Sanskrit kāla (CDIAL 3084), and நிலை, \"a state, a standing\" (DEDR 3675)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
